logbook2~
Day 17:  Saw a suspicious man today.  He was watching me through the trees,
then disappeared when I called out to him.  I must watch my back.

Day 18:  I was ambushed by a group of bandits!  They bound me and took me to
their hideout behind a huge oak tree.  They each had a magical branch that
opened the tree like a door!  I stole one, I'm going to hide it in my boot.
Their leader said now that they had the treasure, I am to be slain and dumped
in the "usual spot", wherever that is.  I fear this may be my last entry.
~
E
logbook1~
Day 14:  Employed by King Drazuk of the Ghoul Kingdom.  He wants me to deliver
a precious treasure to the King of the Dwarves.  He said it may be dangerous,
but I'll take it since he's paying double the normal fee.

Day 16:  Took me two whole days just to get out of the caverns.  Had to dodge
many dangerous beasts in there.  The catacombs of the church were not much
better.  Finally reached the trail through the forest.  Will camp here and
head out at first light.

Look "logbook2"
~
