diary2~
Day 6:  A ghoul scout made it all the way to the hideout undetected!  We got
him, but not before he killed another 3 men.  I must get rid of this treasure.
 I'm having one of the men deliver it to the Boss.  He'll be able to protect
it better...to bad, it was a nice object, but not worth my life.  The gypsies
stopped by later to do some trading.  Thieving scoundrels, always drive a hard
bargain!

Day 7:  Damn!  I can't find the key to the Boss's mansion anywhere!  He will
freak out if he finds out I lost it.  The only thing I can think happened with
it is that one of those gypsies must of pickpocketed it.  Little do they know,
one of the scouts found the magic roses they use to enter their valley...now
to just get there in one piece.
~
E
diary1~
Since we moved to the new hideout, I figured I'd keep better notes about our
doings.

Day 4:  Scouts brought in a messenger.  He had a nice treasure that he said he
was transporting for the Ghoul King.  I'm not sure what to do with it...I'd
hate to feel the wrath of the King Ghoul, but maybe he won't find out if I
keep it.

Day 5:  Had the men dump the messenger's body in the small canyon.  Two scouts
disappeared today, with evidence of ghoul tracks about the bodies.  They must
be looking for the treasure!

Look "diary2".
~
