E
demon1~
A small tome with notes about demon summoning...the newest entry catches your
eye.

Met with the Dark Prince today.  He was in a real bad mood.  Seems the Boss of
the bandits promised him a sacrifice for some help, but hasn't kept up his end
of the deal.  The Prince wasn't sure what to do about this, until I mentioned
that one of our own had stolen a key that opened up the Boss's keep.  The
Prince got real excited at this news, and asked me for it.  After bargaining,
he gave me a small stone that would allow me to journey to his sub-realm at
any time.  The shard should allow access to a small forest trail, and the
Prince said to then just step through the pentagram, and I would appear in his
domain.  Wait until the seer hears about this!
~
