E
sign small wood tree~
ATTENTION:  The path through the Elder Forest is quite safe until you reach
the end.  However, if you are to wander off the path, be prepared for pretty
much anything.  Once you have left the main path, you may find trouble finding
your way back, and the magic of the Elder Oaks prevents nearly all forms of
astral travel.  The creatures that live in the forest do not take kindly to
intruders and will probably attack on sight.  Groups of adventurers of skill
level 20 through 35 are recommended if you plan on leaving the path.  Even
then, some places may be quite rough.
~
