#16010
The Huge Oak~
The forest itself darkens as you proceed down the path, but still, despite the
weather, the air around you is warm, the bird's songs are happy, and you feel
as safe as you've ever felt.  This part of the path is dominated by a gigantic
oak tree.  It's width is equal to at least 30 of the elder oaks and it stands
as high as 15 of them!  The brambles grow so thick about it, you see no way
around it.
~
